          "id": "a97423b4a31231bc59cf92074132f7eeb0316888",
          "message": "Revert \"[Breaking] Rework MMC1 banking. (#204)\"\n\nThis reverts commit dc848e7226163ae345cca210d44f18c04e50f1d8.\n\nThis generally needs more work; I have accidentally introduced C into\nthe NMI path, and it may use RC registers, which aren't saved by the NMI\nprologue/epilogue. It's also become clear that I don't have a good model\nfor how reentrant these routines need to be.",
