          "id": "ba6f4d2af5124a9717e42b0ecab694e977cfb2e0",
          "message": "Remove weak from the malloc family\n\nThese never should have been marked weak; it's an error to override one\nbut still use the others. Regular static library extraction semantics\nensure that they can still be overridden as a unit.",
