          "distinct": true,
          "id": "2850b2ac7d7fd17b29354eaf25cdfc042b50aae6",
          "message": "[Breaking] Exit by return to BASIC on Commander X16\n\nUnlike the other commodore targets, the Commander X16 BASIC functions\nmuch more like a shell, and pain was taken to limit its zero page usage\nto the region traditionally associated with the KERNAL. These together\njustify an exception; our existing CX16 linker script didn't actually\nclobber BASIC ZP.",
          "timestamp": "2024-07-10T11:36:48-07:00",
          "tree_id": "9c7f94bcba80719d5f8e5e9b793e71b9fe7ce0c4",
