          "distinct": true,
          "id": "ac1130c90db43756b7694bc583ba9fca0e344e16",
          "message": "fds: Add initial support (#414)\n\n* fds: Add initial support\n\nIncludes mapper and IRQ support. Outputs a raw executable file that can\nbe written to a disk image using external tools.\n\n* fds: Address review comments\n\n* fds: Change NMI_ACTION_USER to NMI_ACTION_USER_1\n\n* fds: Fix timer IRQ control bitwise operation\n\nNot sure how I keep mixing up my ANDs and ORs.\n\n* fds: Move common.ld inside link.ld\n\n* fds: Fix irq.h guard\n\n* fds: Use INFO section type for vectors\n\n* fds: Include header files in their respective C files\n\n* fds: Fix FDS_APU using __apu struct\n\n* fds: Correct zero page size\n\n* fds: Remove flags from vectors section\n\n* fds: Merge all linker scripts\n\n* fds: Replace skip bytes macro with documentation\n\n* fds: Add license bypass\n\n* fds: Add documentation README\n\n* fds: Make bypass weak\n\nHad to move the vectors to the linker script to get this working.\n\n* fds: Remove leaf attribute from mapper C functions",
          "timestamp": "2025-11-04T10:16:45-08:00",
          "tree_id": "74de80e1fe4d845a95876fbd922c9cbd9c5f5486",
